# 301 redirects from the old LeadConnector site → new Astro URLs.
# Format: <old-path>  <new-path>  <status>
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the deploy root.

# Canonical host: www → apex.
# NOTE (2026-07-06): Cloudflare Pages does NOT support domain-level redirects in
# _redirects ("Domain-level redirects ❌" — developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/),
# so the rule below is parsed but never fires. Kept to document intent.
# The actual www → apex 301 must be a Redirect Rule (Rules → Redirect Rules)
# on the monteroshardwoodflooring.com zone in the Cloudflare dashboard.
https://www.monteroshardwoodflooring.com/* https://monteroshardwoodflooring.com/:splat 301

# Homepage alias
/home  /  301

